[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_TECHNOLOGY]
“Anything but Apple Cider”

[en.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
Ponyville, being the largest rural town in Equestria and one of the few transport centers in Equestria, has seen many surprising new inventions as they circulate from Las Pegasus to Manehattan, from Appleloosa to Canterlot, from Crystal Empire to Fillydelphia, or perhaps the other way around. What do the residents of Ponyville think about industrialization? Do they welcome it with open hooves, or do they oppose it with all their might, or do they simply not care as long as it doesn’t affect their lives? Nevertheless, even though those steam-powered or magic-powered machines have been refused by the Ponyville citizens once, it doesn’t mean that they won’t embrace a second coming.

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_TECHNOLOGY]
“除了苹果汁别的都行”

[zh.FOCUS_C02_PONYVILLE_TECHNOLOGY_desc]
小马谷，作为小马利亚最大的农村城镇，也是小马利亚少数的交通枢纽之一，自然也见证过许多有趣的新发明，那些物件从洛马基流通到马哈顿，从苹果鲁萨流通到坎特洛特，从水晶帝国流通到小马德菲亚，或者反过来的时候，都会要经过小马谷。小马谷的居民对待工业化究竟是什么态度呢？是热烈欢迎，还是强烈反对，又或是只要不影响到他们的生活，他们就不会在意？不论如何，即使那些蒸汽或是魔能驱动的机器曾经被小马谷的居民拒绝过一次，这并不代表他们不会欢迎第二次降临。

